{"v":4,"catch":"擦除、拉伸和連結！\n摧毀障礙德洛斯！","desc":"《Tecmo Stackers》是TECMO於1995年推出的益智遊戲。\n將掉落的球與相同顏色的球匹配，使它們消失。\n消失的球附近的球會受到驚訝並左右拉伸，產生意想不到的連鎖反應。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2024-08-08","genres":["益智","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/57735f271b2eeaf43f58fa4cce0b41f8296b5e17436484a1aab26f9399ffcc9b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/544a2a4019f2964c6753c8e5ef97728c1aa997e55532898dcb3b36d6983e0f22.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1adcf9db215d9be84f1e37c29550cd2dfd1d5710a90d4df42dc2e86965e393f2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5dbe50536ec80d4ced598e0564686409e9a76fd85ae7b14dd26a1b5e0dde0d54.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cd211119bf41510f6c8138102ae489172ac318d3986044b546a3df07b329421d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/46e3444bb0a760a8fcb981b2f0b9e4224cd68687113bff1daf9e7e3802f57053.jpg"],"titleId":"0100ab301f812000","dlc":[]}